  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">template &lt;typename G&gt; <a href=\"#class-decl\">E</a> ErrorOr (G &amp;&amp;defaultError) const &amp;noexcept(<a class=\"cppref\" href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/types/is_copy_constructible\" title=\"cppreference.com (C++17)\">std::is_nothrow_copy_ constructible</a>&lt; <a href=\"#class-decl\">E</a> &gt;::value &amp;&amp;<a class=\"cppref\" href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/types/is_constructible\" title=\"cppreference.com (C++17)\">std::is_nothrow_constructible</a>&lt; <a href=\"#class-decl\">E</a>, G &amp;&amp;&gt;::value);</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Return the contained error or the given default error. If *this contains an error, it is returned. Otherwise, the specified default error is returned, static_cast’d to E</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n\n"
